                                                "sense_id": "ac9f0a6d-e936-3206-9013-33cb965e581f",
                                                "text": "And there he lingered till the crowing cock, / The Alectryon of the farmyard and the flock, / Sang his aubade with lusty voice and clear, / To tell the sleeping world that dawn was near."
                                            },
